<article class="tm-article">
  <nav class="tm-breadcrumb"><a href="/hc/en-us">Help Center</a> / Frequently asked questions</nav>

  <div class="tm-faq-item">
    <h3>Can I change or cancel my order?</h3>
    <p>Yes, as long as it hasn't been packed. Use <a href="/hc/en-us/p/fortrydelse_af_afsendelse">Cancel a shipment</a> or contact us with your order number. Once the parcel is on its way, you can simply return it under the 30-day money-back guarantee.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tm-faq-item">
    <h3>How long does delivery take?</h3>
    <p>In-stock items ordered before 15:00 on weekdays ship the same day and arrive in Denmark within 2–4 working days. See <a href="/hc/en-us/p/biogas-til-transport">Shipping &amp; delivery</a> for express and bulky-freight options.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tm-faq-item">
    <h3>Is shipping free?</h3>
    <p>Shipping to Denmark is free on orders from 1,100 kr. Below that we charge a flat 89 kr per order.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tm-faq-item">
    <h3>How does the 30-day money-back guarantee work?</h3>
    <p>Try the product at home and, if it isn't right, register a return within 30 days of delivery. We refund the full purchase price once the item is back with us. The steps are in <a href="/hc/en-us/p/saadan-produceres-biogas">How to return an item</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tm-faq-item">
    <h3>What does the 3-year warranty cover?</h3>
    <p>Manufacturing and material defects for three years from delivery – repair, replacement or refund. Wear parts such as strings, tubes and drum heads are excluded. Details under <a href="/hc/en-us/p/shell-og-nature-energy">Warranty &amp; repairs</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tm-faq-item">
    <h3>Which payment methods do you accept?</h3>
    <p>Card, PayPal, Klarna (including instalments) and bank transfer. See <a href="/hc/en-us/p/groen-gas-til-hjemmet">Payment methods &amp; invoices</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tm-faq-item">
    <h3>My tracking hasn't updated – what should I do?</h3>
    <p>Carrier systems can take up to 24 hours to update after shipping. If nothing changes for three working days, contact us and we will open an enquiry with the carrier. More in <a href="/hc/en-us/p/hvad-er-biogas">Where is my order?</a>.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tm-faq-item">
    <h3>Can I get advice before I buy?</h3>
    <p>Absolutely. Our product specialists are musicians themselves – <a href="/hc/en-us/requests/new">send us a request</a> with what you play and your budget, and we will recommend the right gear.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="tm-callout">
    Didn't find an answer to your question? <a href="/hc/en-us/requests/new">Contact our customer service</a> and we'll help you further.
  </div>
</article>
